#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.8.0"
msgstr "v1.8.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.8.0 is a WiFi-and-tuning release: it speeds up the WINC SPI bus, fixes a "
"batch of WINC socket bugs, caps the maximum FPS reduction, and changes the "
"default auto-gain ceiling to 8x. The gain-ceiling default change is a "
"behavior change — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v1.8.0 adalah rilis WiFi dan penyetelan: mempercepat bus SPI WINC, "
"memperbaiki sekumpulan bug socket WINC, membatasi pengurangan FPS maksimum, "
"dan mengubah batas gain otomatis default menjadi 8x. Perubahan default batas"
" gain adalah perubahan perilaku — baca perubahan yang dapat merusak di "
"bawah."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "On this page"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:19
msgid "**Faster WiFi** — higher WINC SPI baud rate, with socket fixes."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi lebih cepat** — laju baud SPI WINC lebih tinggi, dengan perbaikan "
"socket."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:20
msgid "**FPS cap** — the maximum FPS reduction is capped at 1/2 FPS (30 FPS)."
msgstr ""
"**Batas FPS** — pengurangan FPS maksimum dibatasi pada 1/2 FPS (30 FPS)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the default auto-gain ceiling changed to 8x — see the breaking"
" changes."
msgstr ""
"**Breaking:** batas gain otomatis default berubah menjadi 8x — lihat "
"perubahan yang dapat merusak."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:25
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:27
msgid "Added an FPS test script."
msgstr "Menambahkan skrip uji FPS."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:30
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"Raised the WINC SPI baud rate / speed for faster WiFi; capped the maximum "
"FPS reduction at 1/2 FPS (30 FPS); cleaned up the debug logging and the "
"MJPEG streaming example."
msgstr ""
"Meningkatkan laju baud / kecepatan SPI WINC untuk WiFi lebih cepat; "
"membatasi pengurangan FPS maksimum pada 1/2 FPS (30 FPS); membersihkan "
"logging debug dan contoh streaming MJPEG."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:37
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"Fixed the default framebuffer state, WINC socket ``accept`` info, WINC "
"``socket_send``, and cleaned up the socket / async-request error handling."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki status buffer bingkai default, info ``accept`` socket WINC, "
"``socket_send`` WINC, dan membersihkan penanganan error socket / async-"
"request."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:43
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang dapat merusak"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v1.7.0 and v1.8.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat oleh pengguna antara v1.7.0 dan v1.8.0. Lingkup:"
" C-module Python di ``modules/`` dan pustaka Python di "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"The breaking change is a *behavior* change (same API, different result) — "
"re-check affected scripts. Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan yang dapat merusak adalah perubahan *perilaku* (API sama, hasil "
"berbeda) — periksa ulang skrip yang terpengaruh. Setiap hash commit "
"terhubung ke diff-nya di GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:54
msgid "Default auto-gain ceiling changed to 8x *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Batas gain otomatis default berubah menjadi 8x *(perilaku)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:56
msgid ""
"The default auto-gain ceiling was changed to 8x. Scripts that relied on the "
"previous default gain ceiling will see different image brightness/noise "
"under auto-gain — set an explicit gain ceiling if you need the old behavior."
msgstr ""
"Batas gain otomatis default diubah menjadi 8x. Skrip yang mengandalkan batas"
" gain default sebelumnya akan melihat kecerahan/noise citra yang berbeda di "
"bawah gain otomatis — atur batas gain yang eksplisit jika Anda membutuhkan "
"perilaku lama."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:60
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `bdafca5a7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bdafca5a7>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `bdafca5a7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bdafca5a7>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:65
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Daftar periksa migrasi"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:67
msgid ""
"Set an explicit gain ceiling if your script depended on the previous default"
" (:ref:`the gain-ceiling change <v1_8_0_gainceiling>`). All other scripts "
"run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Atur batas gain yang eksplisit jika skrip Anda bergantung pada default "
"sebelumnya (\\ :ref:`perubahan batas gain <v1_8_0_gainceiling>`\\ ). Semua "
"skrip lainnya berjalan tanpa perubahan."
